      "narrative": null,
      "content": "UNAIDS Working Group\nTitle\nYear\nTopic \nHIV surveillance among hard to reach populations\n2011\nUpdate on methodologies for conducting HIV \nsurveillance among  most-at-risk populations. \nGuidelines on Estimating the Size of Populations Most \nat Risk to HIV\n (UNAIDS/WHO)\n2010\nUpdate on methodologies for estimating the size of \nmost-at-risk populations.\nhttp://www.globalhealthsciences.ucsf.edu/PPHG/\nsurveillance/who_trainings.html\nTesting Technologies in Surveillance:\nSelection, Evaluation, and Implementation: update \n2009\n2009\nAn update in guidance on selecting and utilizing  \nappropriate HIV test",
